# Keys for the paid voices. Both are optional: the free voices need no key.
#
# 1. Copy this file to .env.local in the folder you make sketches in.
# 2. Paste your key after the = sign, with no quotes or spaces. Leave a line empty if you do not use that service.
# 3. Make sure .gitignore lists .env.local, so the key is never committed. The tool refuses to use it otherwise.
#
# Never put a real key in this file: .env.example is shared with everyone who has the skill.

# ElevenLabs: voices, sound effects and music. Create a key at https://elevenlabs.io/app/settings/api-keys
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=

# Sarvam: Indian English and ten Indian languages. Create a key at https://dashboard.sarvam.ai
SARVAM_API_KEY=
